            <title>3.16.7</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:24:17 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>194</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.16.7</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Bug Fixes
- Claude Code extension 2.1.311 now starts in Canopy. It failed during activation because a VS Code API it calls was missing, so sessions stayed on 2.1.310.
- Canopy now reports telemetry as enabled by default, as VS Code does. Before, the Claude CLI started with telemetry disabled, which also turned off its feature flags. To opt out, set `telemetry.telemetryLevel` in Canopy's settings.json. A project's `.vscode/settings.json` does not change it, matching VS Code.
]]></description>
